000100* ACCTREC  - ACCOUNT MASTER RECORD (152 BYTES)
000200     05  ACCT-ID                PIC X(10).
000300     05  ACCT-STATUS            PIC X.
000400     88  ACCT-ACTIVE            VALUE 'A'.
000500     88  ACCT-CLOSED            VALUE 'C'.
000600     05  ACCT-NAME              PIC X(30).
000700     05  ACCT-BALANCE           PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
000800     05  ACCT-OPEN-DATE         PIC 9(8).
000900     05  ACCT-OPEN-DATE-R       REDEFINES ACCT-OPEN-DATE.
001000     10  ACCT-OPEN-YYYY         PIC 9(4).
001100     10  ACCT-OPEN-MM           PIC 99.
001200     10  ACCT-OPEN-DD           PIC 99.
001300     05  ACCT-TRAN-CNT          PIC S9(7) COMP.
001400     05  ACCT-HIST              OCCURS 12 TIMES.
001500     10  ACCT-HIST-AMT          PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
001600     05  FILLER                 PIC X(20).
